<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Next Thread · Networking Review</title><script>/*__PFAI_HELPER__*/</script><link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css"></head><body><div class="shell"><header><div class="brand"><svg class="mark" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="2" width="44" height="44" rx="8" fill="#125840"/><path d="M10 31h9l7-15h12M10 20h9l8 12h11" stroke="#f1df9b" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><div><div class="wordmark">Next Thread</div><div class="eyebrow">The networking review desk</div></div></div><div class="topactions"><span class="mode" id="mode">Connecting…</span><button id="connect" hidden>Use real AI</button><button data-pf="tests" id="testsOpen">Test view</button></div></header><div class="intro"><div><div class="eyebrow">Tuesday, 18 November 2025 · fictional review day</div><h1>Pick up the right conversation.</h1><p>Review a fictional networking case, inspect the evidence, then decide what enters your daily list. Start with the warm follow-up. This in-page master file is a mock Excel record; nothing is actually sent or synced.</p></div></div><div class="tabs"><button id="deskTab" class="tab active">Review desk</button><button id="testTab" class="tab">Evals</button></div><main id="desk" class="workspace"><aside class="sidebar"><div class="eyebrow">Daily inbox · 8 scenarios</div><h2>Choose a case</h2><div id="caseList"></div><p class="muted">All people, organizations, notes and dates are synthetic.</p></aside><div><article class="panel"><div class="stages"><div class="stage active" id="st1"><span>01</span>Input</div><div class="stage" id="st2"><span>02</span>Context</div><div class="stage" id="st3"><span>03</span>Decision</div><div class="stage" id="st4"><span>04</span>Output</div><div class="stage" id="st5"><span>05</span>Review</div></div><div class="body"><section class="section"><h3>Input · contact arriving</h3><div id="input"></div><div class="row"><button class="primary" id="run" data-pf="run">Review this case</button></div><div id="working" class="working" hidden>Reading the master file and checking the contact rules…</div><div id="error" data-pf="error" class="error" hidden></div></section><section class="section"><h3>Context · source records</h3><div id="context"></div></section><div id="result" data-pf="result" hidden><section class="section"><h3>Decision · reasoning and sources</h3><div id="decision"></div></section><section class="section"><h3>Output · proposed record</h3><div id="output"></div></section><section class="section"><h3>Review · your checkpoint</h3><p class="notice">Nothing is sent without human approval.</p><div id="review"></div></section></div></div></article><article class="panel log"><div class="body"><div class="eyebrow">In-page master file · Actions / Interactions / Contacts</div><h2>Run log & daily ledger</h2><p class="muted">Each case run and each human decision is recorded here. Approval is not a sent status.</p><div id="log" data-pf="log"><div class="empty">No runs yet. Choose a case to begin.</div></div><div id="ledger"></div></div></article></div></main><main id="evals" hidden><article class="panel"><div class="body"><div class="eyebrow">Human-judged evaluations</div><h2>Eight cases, one policy boundary</h2><div class="score" id="score"></div><p class="muted">Run each case here to fill its actual result. A test run does not update the daily ledger. You choose the verdict.</p><div class="tablewrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Case</th><th>Expected behaviour from plan</th><th>Actual result</th><th>Your verdict and note</th></tr></thead><tbody id="testRows"></tbody></table></div><div class="row"><button id="runAll">Run all eight tests</button><button id="copy">Copy results</button></div><div id="testError" data-pf="error" class="error" hidden></div><div class="section"><h3>Improvement card</h3><div class="grid"><div><label for="before">Before</label><textarea id="before" placeholder="What happened before the change?"></textarea></div><div><label for="change">Change</label><textarea id="change" placeholder="What did you change?"></textarea></div><div><label for="after">After</label><textarea id="after" placeholder="What happened after rerunning?"></textarea></div></div></div><div class="section"><h3>Known limitations</h3><p>Fictional records live only in this visit; this is not an Excel, Gmail, LinkedIn, Granola or calendar connection. Scheduling and sending are human-only. Evals run the proposal but cannot test real-world sending or next-day persistence. Real AI performance still needs your own runs and verdicts.</p><p id="recorded"></p></div></div></article></main><p class="foot">Next Thread · Fictional, local demonstration. A human owns every relationship decision.</p></div><script src="data.js"></script><script src="app.js"></script></body></html>

